{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The Spiral</strong></i><strong> is a first-person roguelike dungeon crawler. Explore the dungeon, find tools for your survival, and try to escape with your life.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Descend into Darkness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an infinite dungeon with randomized layouts, items, and enemies. The deeper you delve, the greater the danger. No two playthroughs are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577020/extras/d7efa9e5b633e5f972a4299d579d6fbc.poster.avif?t=1762202772\" width=1170 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577020/extras/d7efa9e5b633e5f972a4299d579d6fbc.webm?t=1762202772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577020/extras/d7efa9e5b633e5f972a4299d579d6fbc.mp4?t=1762202772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find Powerful Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make use of the dungeon's bounty to survive. More than 100 items are at your disposal, including simple farming tools, legendary weapons, curious potions, and enchanted charms. Mix-and-match over 60 different perks to craft your ultimate arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577020/extras/7714c196499b71f4d9d7e7014f933cfc.poster.avif?t=1762202772\" width=1170 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577020/extras/7714c196499b71f4d9d7e7014f933cfc.webm?t=1762202772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577020/extras/7714c196499b71f4d9d7e7014f933cfc.mp4?t=1762202772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight for Your Life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone. Monsters, nightmares, and other desperate wanderers like you all call the dungeon home. Kill them before they kill you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577020/extras/e5d6af96179b69a64372ead00f8a52c8.poster.avif?t=1762202772\" width=1170 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577020/extras/e5d6af96179b69a64372ead00f8a52c8.webm?t=1762202772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577020/extras/e5d6af96179b69a64372ead00f8a52c8.mp4?t=1762202772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Realize Your Potential</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete objectives to unlock unique challenges that change the rules of the dungeon. Can you clear the dungeon with only basic items? Can you amass a fortune? Dare you try the boss rush?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577020/extras/aad0acfa40c4d176e77bc283fb949c44.poster.avif?t=1762202772\" width=1170 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577020/extras/aad0acfa40c4d176e77bc283fb949c44.webm?t=1762202772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577020/extras/aad0acfa40c4d176e77bc283fb949c44.mp4?t=1762202772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Clarity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/ap