ions, and enchanted charms. Mix-and-match over 60 different perks to craft your ultimate arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577020/extras/7714c196499b71f4d9d7e7014f933cfc.poster.avif?t=1762202772\" width=1170 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577020/extras/7714c196499b71f4d9d7e7014f933cfc.webm?t=1762202772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577020/extras/7714c196499b71f4d9d7e7014f933cfc.mp4?t=1762202772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight for Your Life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone. Monsters, nightmares, and other desperate wanderers like you all call the dungeon home. Kill them before they kill you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577020/extras/e5d6af96179b69a64372ead00f8a52c8.poster.avif?t=1762202772\" width=1170 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577020/extras/e5d6af96179b69a64372ead00f8a52c8.webm?t=1762202772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577020/extras/e5d6af96179b69a64372ead00f8a52c8.mp4?t=1762202772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Realize Your Potential</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete objectives to unlock unique challenges that change the rules of the dungeon. Can you clear the dungeon with only basic items? Can you amass a fortune? Dare you try the boss rush?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poste